for any $\rho>0$.  Thus we get 
\begin{equation}\label{kkt2}
\nabla_x \L(\ox,\olm,\rho)=\nabla \ph(\ox)+ \nabla \Phi(\ox)^*\nabla(e_{ {1}/{\rho}} g)(\Phi(\ox)+\rho^{-1}\olm)=\nabla_x L(\ox,\olm).
